Unova_OpelucidCity_Z121_EventScript_Npc4_Text_0:
	.string "Welcome. Thank you for coming. I am\nOpelucid Pokémon Gym's Leader, Drayden.\pAs the mayor, I've given everything\nto developing the city.\pAs a Trainer, I've simply been pursuing\ngreater strength.\pBut what I'm searching for now is a young\nTrainer who can show me a bright future.\pPerhaps you can show me that future,\nthe way Iris has?$"

Unova_OpelucidCity_Z121_EventScript_Npc4_Text_1:
	.string "Wonderful.\pI'm grateful we had a chance to meet\nand battle.$"

Unova_OpelucidCity_Z121_EventScript_Npc4_Text_2:
	.string "{PLAYER} received the Legend Badge\nfrom Drayden!$"

Unova_OpelucidCity_Z121_EventScript_Npc4_Text_3:
	.string "Well, now. You've obtained all of the\nGym Badges in Unova.\pNow, all Pokémon will obediently follow\nyour commands.\pI also want you to have this.\nIt's a TM I'm particularly fond of.\pIt's called Dragon Tail.$"

Unova_OpelucidCity_Z121_EventScript_Npc4_Text_4:
	.string "Dragon Tail is a move that returns the\ndamaged Pokémon to its Poké Ball.\pIn other words, it switches your\nopponent's Pokémon.$"

Unova_OpelucidCity_Z121_EventScript_Npc4_Text_5:
	.string "Now, I have something to ask of you.\pHead for the Pokémon League and\ngo after Alder.\pThe Pokémon League is past Route 10,\nwhich runs from Opelucid City\l\lto Victory Road.\pI know Alder's strength, but I don't\nknow the depths of N's power...$"

