Unova_OpelucidCity_Z121_EventScript_Npc8_Text_1:
	.string "Let me give you a brief explanation of\nthe trick to the Opelucid Gym!\pThe path around this Gym is shaped like\ntwo dragons.\pThis path changes when you step on\nthe switches on the dragons' arms.\pPay attention to how the dragons'\nnecks move!$"

